// ============================================================
// JPE WRESTLING GM — gamestate.js (Phase 2 modular extraction)
// ------------------------------------------------------------
// Core game data + state lives here: feature flags, brand data,
// wrestler icons + master database + wrestler factory, the central
// `game` state object, foundation systems (brand values + belts),
// joker/PPV data, roster lookup/signing, the categorized logger +
// development log + weekly recap, and the full save/load system.
//
// Classic (non-module) script. It is loaded BEFORE financials.js and
// the main inline script, so its data/functions exist in the shared
// global scope by the time anything runs them. Logic is moved verbatim
// — no behavior changes. Globals are re-exported on window.* at the end
// (required for the `const`/`let` declarations, which aren't auto-
// attached to window in classic scripts).
// ============================================================

// ============================================================
// FEATURE FLAGS — future systems are gated here and ship OFF.
// Flip a flag to true only when the system is actually implemented.
// Render/booking code checks these so scaffolding stays inert.
// ============================================================
